{"id":"wb-3-36","name":"八路军西安办事处旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"八路军西安办事处旧址","text":"国民革命军第八路军西安办事处旧址位于中国陕西省西安市新城区北新街附近的七贤庄1号；曾是全国15个八路军、新四军办事处中成立最早、坚持时间最长、影响最大的办事机构； 1959年改建为八路军西安办事处纪念馆，包括七贤庄一、三、四、七号院；1988年公布为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%85%AB%E8%B7%AF%E5%86%9B%E8%A5%BF%E5%AE%89%E5%8A%9E%E4%BA%8B%E5%A4%84%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":91364234,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91364234","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/572d8f50a1209662a4d6f0b7.jpg","title":"Xi'an_Balujun_Banshichu_Jiuzhi_2014.01.04_09-44-59.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xi%27an_Balujun_Banshichu_Jiuzhi_2014.01.04_09-44-59.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/12/Xi%27an_Balujun_Banshichu_Jiuzhi_2014.01.04_09-44-59.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"西安八路军办事处旧址","width":320,"height":213}}